		{
			"id":"176c321d24a71765",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Alternate Theory - Number Cores\n- This puzzle is unlocked by solving a Family Core using the Number Core theory\n- Herbert said that Simon found a letter from their mother\n- Their mother is Baroness Auravei\n- On the Tunnel I found a file cabinet key with a letter that was directed at the Baroness\n\t- The letter explained about Number Cores\n- This means that this puzzle is probably related to number cores\n- Should I try to give each alphabet character a number?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-187,
			"y":1714,
			"width":1380,
			"height":280,
			"color":"4"
		},
